## B. Persistence across page reload, and does the flag leak into a save?
annotations on page: 3; original /F of #0 = 4; render changed by hiding: True; still hidden after ClosePage+LoadPage: True
FPDF_SaveAsCopy full rewrite while hidden: saved /F of #0 = 6 (leak = True); incremental while hidden: saved /F = 6 (leak = True; incremental length 83004 vs source 52263)
after restoring /F=4: full save /F = 4, incremental save /F = 4 (incremental length 83004: PDFium still writes the touched object; harmless but not byte-identical to the source)

